WEBVTT

00:05:01.422 --> 00:05:03.257
Manhood is a spectrum of identities.

00:05:04.175 --> 00:05:05.760
There is no one way to be a man.

00:05:07.303 --> 00:05:10.848
And sometimes, discovering one’s true
manhood is a lifelong journey.

00:05:13.476 --> 00:05:15.728
Secondly,

00:05:15.728 --> 00:05:16.979
we must be consistent.

00:05:18.522 --> 00:05:20.274
Men,

00:05:20.274 --> 00:05:22.735
especially men of color,

00:05:22.735 --> 00:05:26.906
cannot expect women to stand up for us,

00:05:26.906 --> 00:05:30.576
with us in the face
of systemic oppressions